<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
    <title>Confirmar email</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#E7D8B5;color:#39448B;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
    <div style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;">
      Confirma o teu email para acederes ao Jantar de Gala.
    </div>

    <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="background-color:#E7D8B5;margin:0;padding:32px 16px;">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td align="center">
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="max-width:640px;background-color:#39448B;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 auto;">
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding:40px 28px 32px;background-color:#39448B;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(239,199,194,0.35);">
                    <h1 style="margin:0;color:#ffffff;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:56px;line-height:0.9;font-weight:400;">
                      Jantar de Gala
                    </h1>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:34px 28px 8px;background-color:#F5F6F3;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 18px;color:#39448B;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;">
                      Olá <strong><%= @user_name %></strong>,
                    </p>
                    <p style="margin:0;color:#39448B;font-size:17px;line-height:28px;">
                      Confirma o teu email para terminares a criação da tua conta e acederes à tua área do Jantar de Gala.
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding:28px;background-color:#F5F6F3;">
                    <a href="<%= @confirm_email_link %>" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#7C0B2B;color:#EFC7C2;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.8px;">
                      Confirmar email
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:0 28px 34px;background-color:#F5F6F3;">
                    <p style="margin:0;color:#45503B;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;">
                      Até breve,<br />
                      <strong>CeSIUM</strong>
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:22px 28px 28px;background-color:#E7D8B5;border-top:1px solid rgba(57,68,139,0.14);">
                    <p style="margin:0;color:#39448B;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">
                      Se o botão não funcionar, usa este link:
                      <a href="<%= @confirm_email_link %>" style="color:#7C0B2B;text-decoration:underline;word-break:break-all;"><%= @confirm_email_link %></a>
                    </p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
